{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "label": "AggregateSeedProvider", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verkettet mehrere Seed Provider und probiert sie der Reihe nach, damit derselbe Code-Pfad in K8s, DNS-SD und statischen Deployments laeuft. Ein 403 der K8s-API ausserhalb des Clusters wird so zum No-op statt zum Bootstrap-Fehler. Das optionale zweite Konstruktor-Argument ist ein Log-Callback; er ist per Default ein No-op, weshalb Provider-Fehler ohne ihn stillschweigend verschluckt werden."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_first_wins_fallback", "label": "First-Wins-Fallback-Semantik", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Provider stoppt beim ersten nicht-leeren Ergebnis; eine leere Liste ist kein Fehler, triggert aber den Fallback. Aggregate liefert bewusst keine Vereinigung aller Provider und keine Teilergebnisse - wer die Vereinigung braucht, muss vor Cluster.join pre-mergen oder einen eigenen Provider schreiben. Reihenfolge zaehlt doppelt, weil Timeouts sich stapeln: der bevorzugte Provider zuerst, der Fallback zuletzt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_seedsfromenv", "label": "seedsFromEnv", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zieht eine CSV-Seed-Liste aus einer Env-Var. Als erste Sprosse einer Aggregate-Kette faellt lokales Dev auf die Env-Var und Prod - wo sie nicht gesetzt ist - auf die K8s-API durch."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_kubernetes_api_kubernetesapiseedprovider", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_dns_dnsseedprovider", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_config_configseedprovider", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_first_wins_fallback", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_aggregateseedprovider", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_aggregate_seedsfromenv", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_discovery_seed_providers_config_configseedprovider", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/discovery/seed-providers/aggregate.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "d